{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34110","headline":"杂体诗 苦雨中又作四声诗寄鲁望 平去声 · 皮日休","name":"杂体诗 苦雨中又作四声诗寄鲁望 平去声","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"狂霖昏悲吟，瘦桂对病卧。\n檐虚能彯斜，舍蠹易漏破。\n宵愁将琴攻，昼闷用睡过。\n堆书仍倾觞，富贵未换个。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34110.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34110","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}